<h1>Privacy Policy for Noorly</h1>

<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 2026</p>

<p>Welcome to <strong>Noorly</strong>. Your privacy is important to us.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<p>Noorly does not collect personal information such as your name, email address, or phone number.</p>

<p>If you enable location services, the app uses your device's location only to calculate accurate prayer times and the Qibla direction. Your location is processed on your device and is not intentionally stored or shared by Noorly.</p>

<h2>How We Use Information</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Display prayer times.</li>
  <li>Determine the Qibla direction.</li>
  <li>Send reminder notifications if you enable them.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Sharing</h2>

<p>Noorly does not sell or rent your personal information.</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>The app may use Android or Google system services such as notifications and location, depending on the permissions you grant.</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>Noorly is suitable for users of all ages and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

<p>This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>

